        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/benhimself/{size}/2160_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-12-30T19:08:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>One idea for a variant I had was to play Time Catcylsm, and when you get an extra play from A Rift In Time, rather than playing from the Time Catacylsm environment, you played it from whatever deck the card that got 'normally' played would come from: so if you played a triceratops that turn, the rift in time would play a card from Insula Primalis. If you played the mutant cockroach, the rift in time would play from Pike Industrial, etc. Just play from the TC deck if the card normally played isn't one of the 'from another environment' cards (like Rift In Time itself, or Typhoon)</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:09:10.933Z",
